<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Capture me;</l><l>Be the conqueror of this</l><l>Wild, charging mare.</l><l>Win me Lord,</l><l>And subdue all pow’r of self</l><l>To yield to Thee.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Draw me, Lord;</l><l>Ev’ry heartbeat tends to drift</l><l>My course from Thee.</l><l>Draw me, Lord;</l><l>I would gladly let Thee win</l><l>And yield my sword.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Draw me, Lord;</l><l>Oh, Thy love compels me as</l><l>An ocean’s tide!</l><l>Draw me, Lord;</l><l>For Thy drawing maketh hearts</l><l>To fast pursue.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
